Subject: [PATCH] Add parameterized V2 TCP and compact-block codecs

Keep all network identities and resource quotas caller supplied. Bound transport parsing, retain full witness-specific TxHash matching, and distinguish malformed messages from full-body fallback and unvalidated reconstruction.
